    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "GPT-5.6 Sol is designed for complex work across coding, knowledge work and research, cybersecurity, science, computer use, and design. GPT-5.6 Sol Pro is the highest-capability GPT-5.6 option for difficult tasks and longer-running workflows."
      }
