      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "With GPT-6 in Chat, Intelligent UI can combine text, visuals, and interactive elements when useful. Ordinary text answers are still possible, and no special prompt is required. A response may begin while ChatGPT continues thinking, followed by more detail."
