       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Pro",
       "marks": [
        "b"
       ]
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": " effort, which remains powered by GPT-6 Astra. Availability depends on your plan and workspace access. Update your mobile app to the latest available version. The older ChatGPT desktop apps for macOS and Windows do not support these capabilities; use ChatGPT on the web instead."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Intelligent UI has no separate usage quota. Existing model, tool, and plan allowances still apply. Changes to a conversation’s appearance don’t change your other chats."
